{"title":"Career Roadmap · Landscape Planner","role":"Landscape Planner","summary":"A Landscape Planner works at the intersection of landscape ecology, spatial planning, environmental planning, infrastructure and urban development. The role operates at a larger scale than a conventional landscape designer.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Plan (Bachelor of Planning)","Course":"Landscape / Transport / Infrastructure Planning"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Landscape Planner works at the intersection of landscape ecology, spatial planning, environmental planning, infrastructure and urban development. The role operates at a larger scale than a conventional landscape designer."},{"type":"p","text":"While a landscape designer may focus on an individual garden, park or site, a landscape planner considers the entire network of green and ecological systems across neighbourhoods, cities and regions."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Preparing landscape planning strategies"},{"text":"Mapping ecological assets"},{"text":"Planning green networks and corridors"},{"text":"Integrating landscape with transportation infrastructure"},{"text":"Planning parks and open-space systems"},{"text":"Protecting natural areas"},{"text":"Supporting watershed and stormwater planning"},{"text":"Developing landscape frameworks for new developments"},{"text":"Analysing environmental constraints"},{"text":"Planning climate-resilient landscapes"},{"text":"Integrating biodiversity into spatial plans"},{"text":"Preparing landscape management strategies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Core planning logic"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Natural Systems"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Built Environment"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Transport"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Infrastructure"},{"text":"+"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["Communities","Landscape Analysis","Ecological + Spatial Strategy","Green / Blue Network","Landscape Plan","Implementation + Management"]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizon","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Planning + environmental foundations"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Landscape systems + GIS"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Ecology + green infrastructure"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Landscape planning + professional internship"}],[{"text":"0–2 years"},{"text":"Planning / Landscape Planning Assistant"}],[{"text":"2–5 years"},{"text":"Landscape Planner"}],[{"text":"5–8 years"},{"text":"Senior Landscape Planner"}],[{"text":"8+ years"},{"text":"Landscape Planning Lead / Environmental Planning Consultant"}]]}]},{"heading":"Year-Wise Roadmap","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Planning & Environmental Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong fundamentals in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Urban planning"},{"text":"Regional planning"},{"text":"Geography"},{"text":"Environmental studies"},{"text":"Landscape systems"},{"text":"Ecology fundamentals"},{"text":"Basic statistics"},{"text":"Land-use planning"},{"text":"Site analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Understand the relationship between:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Land","Water","Vegetation","Wildlife","Settlements","Infrastructure","Human Activity"]},{"type":"p","text":"The objective is to understand landscapes as systems, rather than simply visual spaces."},{"type":"h","text":"Software"},{"type":"p","text":"Begin with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"QGIS"},{"text":"AutoCAD"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"SketchUp"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 2 — Landscape Systems & Spatial Planning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn how landscape systems operate across different spatial scales."},{"type":"h","text":"Study"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Landscape planning"},{"text":"Landscape ecology"},{"text":"Open-space planning"},{"text":"Urban green spaces"},{"text":"Wate